  "notes": [
    "This buoy carries a Fathom acoustic receiver (the kind used to detect fish fitted with small sound tags) plus water sensors. Fish detections are not part of the public data feed; the page shows the water measurements.",
    "Launched May 2026 off Camp Ellis; moved near Ram Island in mid-September; last reading Sep 24, 2026. Readings taken anywhere other than its two moorings (for example at the dock after recovery) are left out.",
    "Questions about this buoy: Tricia Thibodeau, UNE (pthibodeau1@une.edu)."
